titleStmt.title:
Message From the President’s Deputy Assistant for National Security Affairs
                        (Haig) to the President’s Assistant
                    for National Security Affairs (Kissinger)

note.p:
Source: National Archives, Nixon
                    Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Kissinger Office Files, Box 27, HAK Trip Files, HAK Paris Trip Tohak 100–192 December 3–13, 1972. Top Secret;
                    Sensitive; Exclusively Eyes Only. Sent via Lord.
